OL,5,G1500 They Shoot Horses, Don't They?
OL,6,     FLos Angeles, 1935. George MacKay
OL,7,     Fstars as a young man who enters a
OL,8,     Fbrutal marathon dance on the Santa
OL,9,     FMonica pier, and finds himself
OL,10,     Fdrawn into a bond he cannot
OL,11,     Fescape.
OL,12,G1600 Take Four Books
OL,13,     FThe Irish writer on her latest
OL,14,     Fbook, The Truth About Ruby Cooper,
OL,15,     Fand, together with presenter James
OL,16,     FCrawford, they explore the novel's
OL,17,     Fconnections to three other
OL,18,     Fliterary works.
